  (text "Rev S: pinout VERIFIED vs AKM AK7455 datasheet 200800064-E-00 (avionics/datasheets/ak7455-en-datasheet-myakm.pdf).\n14-bit absolute; Off-Axis (side-of-shaft) supported; 4-wire SPI + ABZ/UVW; anomaly-magnetic-field detection + error\nreduction (suits the ferromagnetic tilt-spar). Supersedes the on-axis MT6701 (rejected: on-axis only, cannot read a\nthrough-shaft off-axis) and the AS5600 Rev Q design."
    (at 24.00 28.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e2000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000a2"))

