  (text "P1: direct-solder 7-wire pigtail (no connector) to node — River (primary) / Simon (alt).\n1=GND 2=+3V3 3=SCLK 4=MOSI 5=MISO 6=CSN 7=ERROR (anomaly-field/low-flux alarm).\nSPI bus is SHARED port+stbd; each nacelle gets its own CSN (no address conflict).\nERROR may be push-pull or open-drain — add a node-side pull-up if open-drain (verify datasheet)."
    (at 55.00 108.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019"))

