  (text "TEST2(13)->VSS. TEST1(12) OPEN. NC pins (8,9,10,19-24) OPEN. Back-tab/EP OPEN (do NOT ground).\nUVW (1,2,3) + ABZ (16,17,18) unused in SPI absolute mode -> no-connect.\nSPI = MISO(4) MOSI(5) SCLK(6) CSN(7). VDD(11)=+3V3, VSS(14)=GND, ERROR(15)."
    (at 133.00 112.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e2000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000007b"))

  (text "OFF-AXIS read (SUPPORTED by AK7455, unlike MT6701/AS5600):\n- Fixed IC on the wing-tip pad, off-axis beside the rotating ring on the tilt-spar hub.\n- Field at the IC must be 10-70 mT (Off-Axis); AK7455 alarms below ~15 mT (low-flux).\n- Set the sense plane via R_FIELDSEL (X-Y / X-Z / Y-Z) to match the mounting.\n- Ferromagnetic 4130/17-4 spar: AK7455 anomaly-field detection + error-reduction +\n  EEPROM INL calibration handle stray field; keep the non-ferrous hub + brass fasteners.\n- Bench-validate flux + INL cal over -5..90 deg (AKM app support). See ENC-NACELLE-1.md."
    (at 24.00 122.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left))
    (uuid "e2000000-0000-0000-0000-00000000007c"))

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
